{
  "id": "E395",
  "title": "Treadmill",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2020-01-18",
  "synopsis": "What kind of treadmill suits Lili best?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50395/c6484cf423619bd46d214a54730a0e4652c67b76.mp3?1578921502",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "跑步机\n\n何京：你在看什么？\n丽丽：我在看跑步机。我打算买一个放在家里。\n何京：你很少锻炼，怎么突然要买跑步机了？\n丽丽：我的几个朋友都买了，还买了不一样的。你来看看，我买哪个好？\n何京：你就买最大的吧。\n丽丽：为什么？跑步机是越大越好吗？\n何京：大的放衣服方便。\n",
    "traditional": "跑步機\n\n何京：你在看什麼？\n麗麗：我在看跑步機。我打算買一個放在家裡。\n何京：你很少鍛鍊，怎麼突然要買跑步機了？\n麗麗：我的幾個朋友都買了，還買了不一樣的。你來看看，我買哪個好？\n何京：你就買最大的吧。\n麗麗：為什麼？跑步機是越大越好嗎？\n何京：大的放衣服方便。\n"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Treadmill"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "何京：你在看什么？",
      "traditional": "何京：你在看什麼？",
      "pinyin": "hé jīng nǐ zài kàn shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He Jing: What are you looking at?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我在看跑步机。我打算买一个放在家里。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我在看跑步機。我打算買一個放在家裡。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ zài kàn pǎo bù jī wǒ dǎ suàn mǎi yí ge fàng zài jiā lǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I’m looking at treadmills. I’m planning to buy one and put it at home."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "何京：你很少锻炼，怎么突然要买跑步机了？",
      "traditional": "何京：你很少鍛鍊，怎麼突然要買跑步機了？",
      "pinyin": "hé jīng nǐ hěn shǎo duàn liàn zěn me tū rán yào mǎi pǎo bù jī le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He Jing: You exercise very rarely. Why do you want to buy a treadmill all of a sudden?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我的几个朋友都买了，还买了不一样的。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我的幾個朋友都買了，還買了不一樣的。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ de jǐ ge péng you dōu mǎi le hái mǎi le bù yí yàng de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "你来看看，我买哪个好？",
      "traditional": "你來看看，我買哪個好？",
      "pinyin": "nǐ lái kàn kan wǒ mǎi nǎ ge hǎo",
      "english": "Lili: Several of my friends have bought one, but they bought different ones."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Come and have a look, which one is better for me to buy?"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "何京：你就买最大的吧。",
      "traditional": "何京：你就買最大的吧。",
      "pinyin": "hé jīng nǐ jiù mǎi zuì dà de ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He Jing: Just buy the biggest one."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "丽丽：为什么？跑步机是越大越好吗？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：為什麼？跑步機是越大越好嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wèi shén me pǎo bù jī shì yuè dà yuè hǎo ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Why? Are treadmills better the bigger they are?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "何京：大的放衣服方便。",
      "traditional": "何京：大的放衣服方便。",
      "pinyin": "hé jīng dà de fàng yī fu fāng biàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He Jing: It's convenient to put clothes on a big one."
    }
  ],
